{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112624","id":2996836268,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6yoBes","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112624","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112624.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112624.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112624","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112624/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112624/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112624/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/9ff89e674188df24738138e9ddaa1e9edb503167","number":112624,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add `@display_if` annotation to GDScript","user":{"login":"GabCoolDude","id":123309403,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1mNWw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123309403?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude","html_url":"https://github.com/GabCoolDude","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"# Overview\r\n\r\nThis PR allows you to conditionally hide/show exported properties based on a bool with a new `@export_if` annotation:\r\n```gdscript\r\n# Before (needs @tool):\r\n@export var is_alive : bool:\r\n\tset(value):\r\n\t\tis_alive = value\r\n\t\tnotify_property_list_changed()\r\n@export var health: int\r\n\r\nfunc _validate_property(property: Dictionary):\r\n\tif property.name == \"number\" and not is_alive:\r\n\t\tproperty.usage |= ~PROPERTY_USAGE_EDITOR\r\n\r\n\r\n# After (doesn't need @tool):\r\n@export var is_alive := true\r\n@export @display_if(\"is_alive\") var health: int\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt works by adding \"condition: {argument}\"  `hint_string`. Then in an `EditorInspectorPlugin` (alongside an `EditorPlugin`), we use `get()` on the object to obtain the condition, if it doesn't exist or isn't a `bool`, it fails and throws an error. Then, if the condition is true, we hide the property's associated `EditorProperty`.\r\n\r\nThe argument has to be the name of a boolean that's declared (either via static typing or by assigning a default value). Passing a `bool` instead of a `String` is not possible, more info on this in the [proposal (comment)](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/9842#issuecomment-2136587725).\r\n\r\nCloses godotengine/godot-proposals#9842\r\n\r\n## Known issues\r\n\r\n- Doing the equivalent of `@display_if` with `[Export(hintString : \"condition: ConditionName\")]` in C# does not properly hide certain data types (Node, Resource, typed Array, typed Dictionary and possibly more)\r\n\r\n# TODO\r\n\r\n- [ ] Find a way to automatically update the inspector instead of having to click away (need help on this one)\r\n- [ ] Investigate possibility of adding a `[ExportIf(bool condition)]` attribute in C#, possibly in another PR\r\n- [ ] Figure out if autocompletion is possible, and if so how (haven't looked into this yet)\r\n- [ ] Add this to properties exported by the editor where it fits","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-11-10T21:34:17Z","updated_at":"2025-11-12T05:06:40Z","closed_at":"2025-11-11T22:22:06Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"0bc7ea20a730cb214d0c3844c5aad6daefe925fc","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"GabCoolDude:export-if-annotation","ref":"export-if-annotation","repo":{"id":1025142118,"node_id":"R_kgDOPRptZg","name":"godot","full_name":"GabCoolDude/godot","owner":{"login":"GabCoolDude","id":123309403,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1mNWw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123309403?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude","html_url":"https://github.com/GabCoolDude","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabCoolDude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https:/